        : <>The code (stacking and denoising stages, bench tools) is in the <a href={release.repo}>FLOAT repository</a>, under the GPL v3 licence; the pretrained model ships with the software. The Rosette data set is <a href={rosette}>downloadable</a> under the CC BY 4.0 licence.</>}</p>
